  "pitchStory": {
    "zh": "彰化二林的小型酪農場，8 頭乳牛 + 200 隻蛋雞。我們不追求規模化 — 一頭牛我們認得每天的食量、產乳量、心情。糞肥不買化肥，自家做堆肥還田。蛋雞用稻穀混飼料、不關籠。動物福祉乳業標章 2025 年申請中，希望能成為彰化第一張。週供應 200-400 kg 鮮乳 + 30 dz 雞蛋。",
    "en": "Small dairy farm in Erlin, Changhua: 8 cows + 200 layers. We don't scale up — with one cow we know her daily intake, milk yield, even her mood. We compost our own manure instead of buying synthetic fertilizer. Layers feed on rice grain + mixed feed, no cages. Animal welfare dairy cert pending in 2025 — hoping to be the first in Changhua. Weekly supply: 200-400 kg fresh milk + 30 dozen eggs."
